@startuml
[*] --> IMPLEMENTED
IMPLEMENTED --> VALIDATING
VALIDATING --> QUALITY_REVIEW : complete immutable results
QUALITY_REVIEW --> SECURITY_REVIEW
SECURITY_REVIEW --> READY_FOR_DELIVERY_REVIEW : all required evidence passes
READY_FOR_DELIVERY_REVIEW --> AWAITING_DELIVERY_APPROVAL
AWAITING_DELIVERY_APPROVAL --> DELIVERY_APPROVED : verified human approval
VALIDATING --> IMPLEMENTED : bounded remediation
DELIVERY_APPROVED --> VALIDATING : artifact or policy changed
AWAITING_DELIVERY_APPROVAL --> VALIDATING : evidence expired
@enduml
